{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前無綫花旦朱智賢（Ashley）先後參選2012年和2013年《香港小姐競選》，之後簽約無綫成為藝人正式入行，她於2023年在IG發長文宣布即將離巢無綫，結束10年賓主關係。她曾大呻請了一位「極品」工人姐姐，對方不只不滿返工不能用電話，又指好攰不想放狗，激到朱智賢要在Instagram大呻特呻。日前朱智賢再分享工人姐姐離譜事，對方竟直接用人話問隻狗食不食飯，令朱智賢哭笑不得。</p><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146758930308009984305762.jpeg/7wNupZIDurzpnvkbQL55WEC0cpWKjF6JNF0IGTRdCBk\"/><figcaption>朱智賢（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢身材出眾。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146758934825537536932584.jpeg/k0rBvqoIteBHih3qbgzkJ1LrbFSxMqxOKmUU2CplFNg\"/><figcaption>朱智賢身材出眾。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><p>朱智賢再揭工人姐姐離譜事</p><p>朱智賢養了一隻鬥牛犬名為「Taco」。朱智賢日前在Instagram限時動態透露，她叫工人姐姐問問Taco是否要食飯，工人姐姐竟直接用人話問牠：「姐姐問我Taco食嘢未 然之後我話你問吓佢食唔食嘢啦 跟住對住Taco講”Taco do you want to eat？”」使朱智賢哭笑不得道：「其實我嘅意思係想佢同Taco講\"食mummum”咁如果佢有反應即係想食，如果佢繼續瞓覺就唔使理佢，但係我冇諗過佢 真係直接用人話問Taco」。</p><p>朱智賢又呻，工人姐姐發訊息問如何用狗繩，朱智賢無奈指已教了3、4次，工人姐姐僅能發訊息道歉：「I forget miss I'm sorry」。</p><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢再揭工人姐姐的離譜事。（IG：@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197630881230360576816972.jpeg/uKLVMgjx1_1PydzUssHFDwNtht34KyQotULluLVC5bg\"/><figcaption>朱智賢再揭工人姐姐的離譜事。（IG：@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢再揭工人姐姐的離譜事。（IG：@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197630878873030656401638.jpeg/zOsojeOMWYIJHkFciv0BYqJowlpuPD_f3F7jqtxe46o\"/><figcaption>朱智賢再揭工人姐姐的離譜事。（IG：@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢再揭工人姐姐的離譜事。（IG：@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197630876473757696238014.jpeg/uiNar2USaPDpfLKfRY_6mO3vijypipb_wU0iksFNIpI\"/><figcaption>朱智賢再揭工人姐姐的離譜事。（IG：@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢出名是愛狗之人。（IG：@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197630873915101184348691.png/u9s0pIbrhnWQSqqgqASoNUtCeiWsGEuj1QyoOdUMqDk\"/><figcaption>朱智賢出名是愛狗之人。（IG：@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.690896+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":682,"images":6,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T15:59:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T19:07:44.755537+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:17:51.294306+00:00","content_hash":"cd58694c3403b72d21272726c37d4e7791776e2909ccead6e0bc95e3666c3de1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}